{"dialogue_id": "mt-23-routing-detail", "turn_index": 1, "query": "DRL与GNN结合为什么能泛化到未见网络拓扑？", "ground_truth": "传统神经网络不适合直接学习图结构，而GNN天生面向不同规模和结构的图；论文将GNN嵌入DRL并设计问题特定动作空间，从而使策略能够迁移到未见拓扑。", "relevant_chunk_ids": ["8277b122b6bf049f-C0000", "8277b122b6bf049f-C0002"], "expected_behavior": "answer", "unsupported_requirements": [], "must_preserve": [], "memory_probe": false, "tags": ["four-turn", "generalization", "single-paper"]}
